    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Sci-Fi MMO game in a seamless universe with an emphasis on travel, exploration and quests.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248010/extras/890904414b437fe141980cb35842423e.poster.avif?t=1752789521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248010/extras/890904414b437fe141980cb35842423e.webm?t=1752789521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248010/extras/890904414b437fe141980cb35842423e.mp4?t=1752789521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER</h2><br>Group up with other players, board your vehicles on a space carrier and prepare for a massive orbital airdrop.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIVERSE</h2><br>Seamlessly travel across the entire star system with no distance and speed limits at all.<br>Visit planets and satellites, asteroid fields and orbital stations, industrial facilities and abandoned settlements and more.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EQUIPMENT</h2><br>Arrange and upgrade your tools, equipment and physics-based characters, spaceships and ground vehicles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >QUESTS</h2><br>Make allies with different factions, local inhabitants and other players, and complete various quests and story missions, including co-op ones.",
